# Model weights, pinned by SHA-256. Rule 5.
#
# A weights file that does not match its recorded hash ABORTS THE BOOT. It does
# not warn and continue — a warning at boot is a warning nobody reads.
#
# These are placeholders. Desk refuses to start while any digest is all zeroes,
# so an unfilled pin file fails loudly rather than silently accepting anything.
#
# To fill them in, on the Mac, after the first download:
#     python3 scripts/pin_weights.py ~/.desk/models
# Then check each digest against the publisher's published digest before
# committing. Pinning what you downloaded without checking it pins the
# compromise as readily as the original.
#
# Format is sha256sum's: <digest>  <path relative to ~/.desk/models>

40028e43687458e79ba89cc16bf14184c5414a5cbc00fd511f8f78d138647afd  whisper-small.en/config.json
1bb29b030aca711a035f7a084a0eefac6251ecc2bdd356fa748858fbad082f5a  whisper-small.en/weights.npz
